OL,3,ABritish national among six dead in
OL,4,Abuilding explosion close to Acropolis
OL,5,Ain Athens
OL,6,
OL,7,FSix people have died, including a
OL,8,FBritish national, in an explosion that
OL,9,Fdestroyed a building containing a
OL,10,Fholiday rental property in the historic
OL,11,Fcentre of Athens.
OL,13,FThe blast on Friday happened in the
OL,14,FPlaka area of the Greek capital, a
OL,15,Fneighbourhood close to tourist sites
OL,16,Fsuch as the Acropolis.
OL,18,FFour American holidaymakers were among
OL,19,Fthe dead, along with a UK national and
OL,20,FGreek national - reportedly an elderly
OL,21,Fcouple who lived in the same building.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
