OL,3,AHuge crowds greet Pope in Paris for
OL,4,Aopen-air Mass
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of thousands of people have
OL,7,Fgreeted Pope Leo XIV in the centre of
OL,8,FParis for a giant open-air Mass.
OL,10,FCrowds cheered as the pontiff moved
OL,11,Fdown the Champs-Elysees Avenue beneath
OL,12,Fthe Arc de Triomphe, waving to crowds
OL,13,Ffrom his popemobile.
OL,15,FThe head of the Catholic Church blessed
OL,16,Fseveral babies as he stopped at
OL,17,Fdifferent stages along the avenue as
OL,18,Fchants of "Leo, Leo" rang out.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
