OL,3,ASecurity lapses at Utah campus where
OL,4,ACharlie Kirk was killed, review says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn independent review has pointed to a
OL,7,Fnumber of security shortcomings at the
OL,8,FUtah campus where conservative activist
OL,9,FCharlie Kirk was shot dead last year.
OL,11,FThe report said Utah Valley University
OL,12,F(UVU) did not carry out a proper
OL,13,Fwritten security assessment nor prepare
OL,14,Fan event action plan, deferring key
OL,15,Fdecision-making about the event to
OL,16,FKirk's conservative organisation
OL,17,FTurning Point USA.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
